Z||000000||KissMySSFiero||12-19-2000||01:20 PM||||WELL FOLKS....<BR>got up this morning to go christmas shopping and heard a knock at the door.  sheriff was there tellin me someone broke into my car and tore it up.  went out and it had red spray paint on the rear bumber and drivers side.  windshield smashed with a golf club...stereo taken and subs..amp....and two tires slashed.....been here for 3 months and i already got this s**t happening to me.  and to top it off its less than a week til xmas.  now i have to drop 150 into a windshield and some into tires just to get my car back on the road.  talk about some bulls**t.  now im really Pis*ed.  and to top it off.  insurance wont do a damn thing about it.  merry Friggin christmas to whoever did this(i know its noone from here) but hey it doesntmatter.  all i can do is bend over and take it up the poopshoot.  FU TO THE ONE WHO DID THIS...now im venting...i hope that no one else has to go through this EVER.....<P>------------------<BR>JOEJOE  88FORMULA<BR>KissMySSFiero@netzero.net<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FORUMSIG1.jpg"> ||||reg||9
