Z||000006||loafer87gt||12-19-2000||05:46 PM||||Gawd would it ever feel good to catch one of the ba$tards in action while they were breaking into a car. I know in Canada you aren't allowed to do anything or else you'll get charged for assault, but I'm not sure how it works in the states. My uncle once caught a guy breaking into his 36 Chev hotrod, and he took a baseball bat and a gunny sack outside. After shoving the bag over the guys head, he proceeded to beat him silly with the baseball bat. The guy wasn't able to press charges for assault since he had no clue who the heck gave him the smack down. I just wish I had my unc with me the past three times my car has been broken into and trashed. I have absolutely no respect for car theives and vandals, I group them with murderers and rapists, scum of the earth.||||reg||1
